de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOVE9PZVVLSWpiWnVKZDJNSGI4WmhOYkJIYVBtdjFNdmEtdVd1T0FsN0JPdFp6bzlaanNKakdUT2hFdk5aOVktZENTU1ZxOFV4aThEVnNtS3pRX2hDVmZpNkcybjR3MGw5RmtMZXVSVjBpdklzNGxVOTRGVEpxaWlieTJSaDZDbXlMM29RMXloSmNtOXBCRjlyLUFHdnhBRXdkV0dPYmsyeGs?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"聯想 RTX 5060 遊戲筆記型電腦交易回落至一個月來的最佳價格"},{"title":"Score a huge $1,250 saving on this Alienware gaming PC with an RTX 5070 Ti and 32GB DDR5 right now — big Newegg price drop means you can grab this 4K-ready rig with a 24-core Intel CPU and 1TB SSD for $2,599.99","src":"Tom's Hardware","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"立即購買這款配備 RTX 5070 Ti 和 32GB DDR5 的 Alienware 遊戲 PC，可節省 1,250 美元 — Newegg 大幅降價意味著您可以花 2,599.99 美元購買這款配備 24 核英特爾 CPU 和 1TB SSD 的 4K 設備"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"能源/電力","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-06","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/101829/000010182926000006/rtx-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"RTX Corporation is an aerospace and defense company that provides advanced systems and services for commercial, military, and government customers worldwide. The terms \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" the \"Company\", and \"RTX\" mean RTX Corporation and its subsidiaries, unless the context indicates another meaning. We serve commercial and government customers in both the original equipment and aftermarket parts and services segments of the aerospace industry. Our defense business serves both domestic and international customers as a prime contractor or subcontractor on a broad portfolio of defense and related programs for military and government customers. RTX Corporation was incorporated in Delaware in 1934.","zh":"RTX Corporation 是一家航空航太和國防公司，為全球商業、軍事和政府客戶提供先進的系統和服務。術語「我們」、「我們的」、「本公司」和「RTX」是指 RTX Corporation 及其子公司，除非上下文另有說明。我們為航空航太業的原始設備和售後零件及服務領域的商業和政府客戶提供服務。我們的國防業務作為主承包商或分包商為國內和國際客戶提供服務，為軍事和政府客戶提供廣泛的國防和相關項目。 RTX Corporation 於 1934 年在特拉華州成立。"},{"en":"The following description of our business should be read in conjunction with \"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations\" within Item 7 of this Form 10-K, including the information contained therein under the heading \"Business Overview.\"","zh":"以下對我們業務的描述應與本表 10-K 第 7 項中的「管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論和分析」一起閱讀，包括其中「業務概述」標題下包含的資訊。"},{"en":"Our operations are classified into three principal business segments: Collins Aerospace (Collins), Pratt & Whitney, and Raytheon, with each segment comprised of groups of similar operations.","zh":"我們的業務分為三個主要業務部門：柯林斯航空航太公司（Collins）、普惠公司和雷神公司，每個部門都由類似的業務組組成。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our operations are classified into three principal business segments: Collins Aerospace (Collins), Pratt & Whitney, and Raytheon, with each segment comprised of groups of similar operations.","zh":"我們的業務分為三個主要業務部門：柯林斯航空航太公司（Collins）、普惠公司和雷神公司，每個部門都由類似的業務組組成。"},{"en":"Collins Aerospace is a leading global provider of technologically advanced aerospace and defense products. Collins' solutions include aftermarket services for civil and military aircraft manufacturers, commercial airlines, and regional, business, and general aviation, as well as for defense and commercial space operations. Aftermarket services include spare parts, overhaul and repair, engineering and technical support, training and fleet management solutions, asset management services, and information management services. Collins designs, manufactures, and supplies electric power generation, management and distribution systems, environmental control systems, flight control systems, air data and aircraft sensing systems, engine control systems, engine components, engine nacelle systems, including thrust reversers and mounting pylons, interior and exterior aircraft lighting, aircraft cargo","zh":"柯林斯航空航太公司是技術先進的航空航太和國防產品的全球領先供應商。柯林斯的解決方案包括為民用和軍用飛機製造商、商業航空公司、支線、商業和通用航空以及國防和商業航太運營提供售後服務。售後服務包括備件、大修和維修、工程和技術支援、培訓和車隊管理解決方案、資產管理服務和資訊管理服務。柯林斯設計、製造和供應發電、管理和配電系統、環境控制系統、飛行控制系統、空氣數據和飛機感測系統、發動機控制系統、發動機部件、發動機短艙系統（包括推力反向器和安裝塔）、飛機內部和外部照明、飛機貨物"}],"customers":[{"en":"Collins sells aerospace and defense products and services to aircraft manufacturers, airlines, airports and other aircraft operators, the U.S. and foreign governments, defense contractors, maintenance, repair, and overhaul providers, and independent distributors around the world. Collins' largest commercial customers are Boeing and Airbus with combined sales, prior to discounts and incentives, of 16%, 16%, and 19% of total Collins segment sales in 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively.","zh":"柯林斯向世界各地的飛機製造商、航空公司、機場和其他飛機運營商、美國和外國政府、國防承包商、維護、修理和大修提供商以及獨立分銷商銷售航空航天和國防產品和服務。柯林斯最大的商業客戶是波音和空中巴士，在折扣和激勵措施之前，其銷售額在 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年分別佔柯林斯部門總銷售額的 16%、16% 和 19%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"All of our businesses are subject to significant competition. Our businesses compete on a variety of factors such as price, delivery schedule, past performance, reliability, customer service, innovation, and technology. Many of our competitors have substantial financial resources and significant technological capabilities. Further, some non-U.S. competitors receive government research and development assistance, marketing subsidies, and other assistance for their products beyond the assistance that may be available to us as a U.S. company.","zh":"我們所有的業務都面臨激烈的競爭。我們的業務在價格、交貨時間表、過去的業績、可靠性、客戶服務、創新和技術等多種因素上進行競爭。我們的許多競爭對手都擁有雄厚的財力和顯著的技術能力。此外，一些非美國競爭對手的產品也獲得政府研發援助、行銷補貼和其他援助，而這些援助超出了我們作為美國公司所能獲得的援助。"},{"en":"Our aerospace businesses compete with numerous U.S. and foreign businesses that obtain regulatory agency approval to manufacture products and spare parts. Customer selections of aircraft engines, components, and systems can also have a significant impact on future sales of parts and services. In addition, customers (including the U.S. government and other governments) may purchase parts from suppliers other than the original equipment manufacturer, which affects spare parts sales. Some competitors may offer substantial discounts and other financial incentives, performance and operating cost guarantees, and participation in financing arrangements in an effort to compete for the aftermarket associated with these products.","zh":"我們的航空航太業務與眾多獲得監管機構批准生產產品和備件的美國和外國企業競爭。客戶對飛機引擎、零件和系統的選擇也會對未來零件和服務的銷售產生重大影響。此外，客戶（包括美國政府和其他政府）可能會從原始設備製造商以外的供應商購買零件，這會影響備件銷售。一些競爭對手可能會提供大幅折扣和其他財務激勵、性能和營運成本保證以及參與融資安排，以爭奪與這些產品相關的售後市場。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Pratt & Whitney","val":32916000000,"zh":"普惠公司"},{"name":"Collins Aerospace","val":30196000000,"zh":"柯林斯航空航天公司"},{"name":"Raytheon","val":28043000000,"zh":"雷神公司"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":210000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":88603000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":64171000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":24432000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":88603000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":47291000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":18799000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":13782000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Geographic Regions","val":5110000000,"zh":"其他地理區域"},{"name":"Middle East & North Africa","val":3621000000,"zh":"中東和北非"}],"total":88603000000}},"peers":["LMT","NOC","GD","LHX","HON"]}}